1
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,360
Why are you asking me

2
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,690
for six million?

3
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,800
I need six million

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,400
to keep a man

5
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,720
for three months.

6
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,120
Fine.

7
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,340
But remember this,

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,600
whether you keep a hundred,

9
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:32,560
a thousand,

10
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:33,930
or ten thousand men,

11
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,360
you, Liu Ruyan,

12
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,720
will always be my woman.

13
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,240
Ruyan.

14
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:45,840
I love you, Ruyan.

15
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:49,080
I'm the only one who truly loves you.

16
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,480
What are you doing?

17
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:00,480
Ruyan is my woman.

18
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:01,560
Do you think I'm blind?

19
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,240
She was never your woman.

20
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,200
She is mine.

21
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:07,040
What gives you the right?

22
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,480
Everything here is mine.

23
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,840
Just now,

24
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,480
I bought everything

25
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:15,080
that belongs to you.

26
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,680
What?

27
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,840
Aren't you just a security guard?

28
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:20,400
I am the first heir to Ousha Group,

29
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,039
Ouyang Tianyi.

30
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,610
I don't care who you are.

31
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:25,300
That kiss just now,

32
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:27,280
I want it back.

33
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,170
Okay.

34
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:32,920
The director is explaining the scene.

35
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,600
Quiet.

36
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,039
Director.

37
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:38,960
Mr. Heying,

38
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:42,280
you truly are the long-time pillar of the musical theater troupe.

39
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:42,640
I'm flattered.

40
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,700
Your expressions,

41
00:01:44,039 --> 00:01:44,720
the feel,

42
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,280
were absolutely wonderful.

43
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:46,759
I'm flattered.

44
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:47,420
That's why,

45
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,039
spending so many years in the musical theater troupe

46
00:01:49,039 --> 00:01:50,360
was really a waste of your talent.

47
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,289
It held you back.

48
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:53,170
What is a real actor?

49
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,759
This is a real actor.

50
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,490
Impressive.

51
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,200
So the short drama track

52
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,280
is the most suitable for you.

53
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,680
But there's just one thing.

54
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,280
It's slightly lacking a bit of...

55
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,000
Passion.

56
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,020
Hold on.

57
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,360
What should you do?

58
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,020
You love this woman very much.

59
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,759
You need to feel her in every way.

60
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,480
Do you understand?

61
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,040
Director.

62
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:12,800
And you.

63
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,240
When you kiss,

64
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,620
you must fully commit.

65
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,240
Right.

66
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,240
Then feel her body temperature,

67
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,400
and her breath.

68
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,530
What do you mean you couldn't stop him?

69
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,540
Take a look at the contract first.

70
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:31,079
Playing the male lead, Ning Caichen.

71
00:02:31,079 --> 00:02:31,720
Yes.

72
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,040
In all the dramas we signed with him before,

73
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,240
he was guaranteed the male lead in every one,

74
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,970
and always as the primary lead.

75
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,730
It's my fault this time.

76
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,960
In order to sign Jin Xi,

77
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,560
I completely

78
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,440
forgot about this.

79
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,500
I even forgot to update the contract.

80
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,340
Therefore,

81
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:48,000
we breached the contract first.

82
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,200
It's understandable that Heying left.

83
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:54,420
But he shouldn't have just left without discussing it with me.

84
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,329
What do we do now?

85
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:01,090
Don't we have two understudies for this play?

86
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:04,500
We must get through this audition first no matter what.

87
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,080
If you really can't stop worrying about Jinxi,

88
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,680
we still have time to find two understudies.

89
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,320
Are you crazy?

90
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:16,079
Are you really going to give up on Top Music Avenue,

91
00:03:16,079 --> 00:03:17,880
this S-tier music variety show?

92
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,840
Brother Jianshe just left.

93
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,280
I can't ask for any more leave.

94
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,600
Just because he left,

95
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,480
they definitely have to interview new actors.

96
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,320
That's why you have a chance to ask for leave.

97
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,560
I can't go.

98
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,640
Don't worry.

99
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,280
Leave it to me.

100
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,200
It's just a matter of me talking to Wu.

101
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:35,400
No.

102
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,280
Do you know how rare this show is?

103
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,360
No.

104
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:39,760
Fine.

105
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,440
I got up early just to accompany you to the interview,

106
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,970
I didn't even attend Tiaotiao's sports meet.

107
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:46,480
I'm sorry,

108
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,320
Hu.

109
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,000
In order to meet the standard

110
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,329
of a real musical actor,

111
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,890
I can't be half-hearted at this stage.

112
00:03:56,079 --> 00:03:57,680
In that case,

113
00:03:59,079 --> 00:03:59,880
bye.

114
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,800
I'm going to Tiaotiao's sports meet.

115
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,440
Are you just going to leave us here?

116
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,840
At least drop us off at the rehearsal room.

117
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:08,680
No.

118
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,280
Sister Hu.

119
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:12,940
Let's go, brother.

120
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,260
Let's get a taxi at the intersection.

121
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,320
So handsome.

122
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,840
After crossing a thousand mountains,

123
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,800
into the bright lights.

124
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,240
Your ties

125
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,680
follow like a shadow.

126
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,480
This is why

127
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,720
Mr. Qingsong is only suited to be a choreographer.

128
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:54,159
Eventually crossing the mountains,

129
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,640
waiting until now.

130
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,860
Stop laughing.

131
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,680
Light clouds and gentle breeze.

132
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,640
Pour more wine.

133
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,170
Is there still no news of Mr. Heying recently?

134
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,560
No.

135
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,360
Then how about we check the places he usually goes?

136
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,840
The last time he came for training

137
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,080
was probably last week.

138
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:18,600
Last week.

139
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,600
Some director named Zha came to see him then.

140
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,160
Director Zha came?

141
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:24,090
They seemed to be discussing shooting a short drama.

142
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:24,930
Short drama?

143
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,280
What short drama?

144
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,000
Those mini-app short dramas.

145
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,200
They're pretty good.

146
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,760
Like 'Dragon King Son-in-law',

147
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:31,680
'Rebirth of the Soldier King',

148
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,240
'Boss Falls for the Nanny',

149
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,520
and 'Rebirth and Counterattack'.

150
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,720
They are really good.

151
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,080
Sir, just swipe your card.

152
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,490
All right, go ahead.

153
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,240
Mr. Heying.

154
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,960
They said you went to act in a short drama.

155
00:06:16,960 --> 00:06:18,800
Do not stand in my way.

156
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,740
Mr. Heying.

157
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,680
Why did you go to act in a short drama?

158
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,840
I don't need to explain my affairs to anyone.

159
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:25,300
Then...

160
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:27,120
Are you going to ignore us and the theater troupe?

161
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:27,880
I said,

162
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,420
don't ask anymore.

163
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,560
I am sorry.

164
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,440
Some things

165
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,840
are destined not to be repeated.

166
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,840
Mr. Heying,

167
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:50,560
you sound weird talking like this.

168
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,960
Are you telling me what to do?

169
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,120
Yes,

170
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:58,200
the director sent me to find you.

171
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Tell the director

172
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:05,440
I won't be going back for a while.

173
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,000
Why?

174
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,240
I said stop asking.

175
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,040
Mr. Heying,

176
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,560
if you don't tell me why,

177
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,480
I won't leave.

178
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,600
Feel your breath.

179
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,640
Stay if you want.

180
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,160
But for now,

181
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,240
relax.

182
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,700
I'm going to my yoga class.

183
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,420
New students, please take a seat.

184
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:31,520
Director.

185
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:33,960
Eating?

186
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:37,760
Let me see.

187
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:46,480
It's the scene with Nie Xiaoqian and Ning Caichen.

188
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,200
I feel like

189
00:07:48,200 --> 00:07:49,330
the atmosphere here

190
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,010
could be built up a bit more.

191
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:55,820
The atmosphere is already there with the music.

192
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:58,080
Is it missing some

193
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:01,160
physical movements to increase their intimacy?

194
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,880
Physical movements?

195
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:03,680
Like what?

196
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,770
For example,

197
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,760
holding hands tightly.

198
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,600
Or

199
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:13,560
Ning Caichen gently stroking Nie Xiaoqian's hair.

200
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:19,480
No,

201
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,680
that's not what I meant.

202
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,480
Stop talking.

203
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,440
You're straying too far.

204
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,900
I really didn't mean that.

205
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:26,760
I figured it out after what happened last time.

206
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:27,960
I need to respect you.

207
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,160
From now until the end of this play,

208
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:33,559
we will just maintain the distance of an actor and a director.

209
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:34,409
Don't worry.

210
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,440
Director.

211
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,090
How is it?

212
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,420
Any news about Heying?

213
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,660
He went with Charlie Wang to shoot short dramas.

214
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,410
Why is it this guy again?

215
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,680
He seems serious this time.

216
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,400
I thought he was just

217
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:57,060
being emotional because of what Sister Hu said.

218
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,610
Why would he go shoot short dramas?

219
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,280
He said

220
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,480
short dramas suit him better than musicals right now.

221
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,160
But I know

222
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:06,290
this isn't how he really feels.

223
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,320
Jinxi.

224
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,800
I'll be blunt.

225
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,920
Ever since you came,

226
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:15,300
Mr. Heying has been very anxious.

227
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:19,570
He feels he has lost his sense of presence and validation in the troupe.

228
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,280
Mr. Heying,

229
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,480
you haven't left yet?

230
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,080
Xiao Qi.

231
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:30,340
How long has it been since you joined the troupe?

232
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,200
Since I graduated,

233
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:34,560
it's been almost a year of interning.

234
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,560
Is that so?

235
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,810
Since the first time I performed in a musical,

236
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:41,560
it's been ten years.

237
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,680
I remember

238
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,880
the first play I saw at the troupe

239
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:48,540
was Mr. Heying's "Cailou Ji".

240
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:53,440
That was the director's first time adapting a traditional play.

241
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:56,440
As the lead actor, you were truly radiant,

242
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,280
and the center of attention.

243
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,160
Now I'm washed up,

244
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:03,400
and completely ignored.

245
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,400
How could that be?

246
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,560
You are still radiant now.

247
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,560
It's just that Jin Xi took your lead role.

248
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:11,560
The director is strict with him,

249
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:13,360
so he pays a little less attention to you.

250
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,560
Jin Xi likes to joke around.

251
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,620
Everyone prefers laughing with him,

252
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,400
so they interact with you a little less.

253
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,280
Putting all that aside,

254
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:21,410
you are still the pillar of our troupe.

255
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,290
Putting all that aside,

256
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,170
what else do I have left?

257
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,040
The fan incident

258
00:10:30,680 --> 00:10:31,800
is exactly

259
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,890
the fuse for his inferiority and anxiety.

260
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,130
Jianshe would think of me this way.

261
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:42,960
Where is he? I'll go find him now.

262
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:43,560
No.

263
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:47,240
I don't believe Jianshe would think of me this way.

264
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:47,760
Xiao Qi.

265
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,640
Wait until the weekend.

266
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,700
We will bring Jianshe back together.

267
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,370
Okay.

268
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,040
Three years.

269
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,160
Three whole years.

270
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,760
Three years ago today.

271
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,560
You forced me.

272
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,100
You forced me to enter on my knees.

273
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,560
Now I want the entire Su family

274
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,770
to kneel and watch me leave.

275
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,820
If you're weak, even breathing is wrong.

276
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,960
Even breathing is wrong.

277
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,800
Du Heying.

278
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,420
You are actually acting in short dramas.

279
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,000
Hello, may I ask who you are?

280
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,960
I've been a fan of yours for years,

281
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,360
silently supporting you.

282
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,080
To restore your artistic dignity,

283
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,760
I didn't hesitate to target

284
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:28,000
Jin Xi, who took away your artistic crown.

285
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,360
But you've willingly stooped so low,

286
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,960
abandoning noble musicals

287
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,820
to become a slave to short dramas.

288
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,140
So you are that fan of mine.

289
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,160
