290
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:39,800
Today,

291
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:42,560
I officially announce that I am no longer your fan.

292
00:11:42,560 --> 00:11:43,680
For the rest of my life,

293
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:46,140
I will treat the name Du Heying like dog shit.

294
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:47,690
