307
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:35,840
What's wrong,

308
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,570
Mr. Jianshe?

309
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,240
Director,

310
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,320
well,

311
00:12:39,640 --> 00:12:40,970
