317
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,040
Yes.

318
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,500
Are you the screenwriter?

319
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,160
Are you the director?

320
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,200
On this set,

321
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,680
