330
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,600
Sorry, director.

331
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,560
Louder.

332
00:13:20,560 --> 00:13:22,120
Aren't you a stage actor?

333
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,440
Sorry, director!

334
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,210
Lunch break!

335
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:35,560
What a jerk.

336
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:36,680
