349
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,440
Jianshe, are you kidding?

350
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,400
You are the star.

351
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,840
Jinxi, you are performing better and better.

352
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,080
There is no place for me in the troupe anymore.

353
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,960
My progress is all because of you.

354
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,280
You taught me acting and singing.

355
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,680
You also taught me what a good musical actor is.

356
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:34,600
I told you I'm old.

357
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,330
Can you not take such big steps?

358
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,330
Your legs are longer than mine.

359
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:39,600
You two.

360
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:42,480
Wait ten seconds before chasing me.

361
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:51,280
Five, four, three, two, one.

362
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,120
Mr. Heying.

363
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:52,920
Jianshe.

364
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:56,280
Mr. Heying.

365
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,040
Mr. Heying.

366
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,120
Mr. Heying.

367
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:05,080
I know where Mr. Heying lives.

368
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:05,940
I'll call a cab.

369
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:06,480
Okay.

370
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:22,880
Mr. Heying.

371
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:29,800
Mr. Heying.

372
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:32,160
Mr. Heying.

373
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:32,680
Jianshe.

374
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:33,080
Mr. Heying.

375
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:33,880
Wait for us.

376
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:35,600
Mr. Heying.

377
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:41,800
Mr. Heying.

378
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:43,000
Jianshe.

379
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:43,930
Stop chasing me.

380
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,690
I won't go back with you.

381
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,320
Mr. Heying.

382
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,920
The troupe really needs you.

383
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,160
Please go back with us.

384
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:50,040
Mr. Heying.

385
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:51,800
Mr. Heying.

386
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:53,800
Mr. Heying.

387
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:54,160
This is not me.

388
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:54,560
What's wrong with you?

389
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:55,360
This is not me.

390
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:56,680
Jinxi.

391
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:58,200
Think of a way quickly.

392
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,280
Jianshe.

393
00:15:59,360 --> 00:15:59,760
Mr. Heying!

394
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,280
Can you please stop shouting?

395
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,740
I will not go back with you.

396
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:03,760
Mr. Heying!

397
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,160
Open the door!

398
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,200
I'm begging you.

399
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:09,400
Mr. Heying!

400
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:18,280
Mr. Heying!

401
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:21,440
Mr. Heying!

402
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,300
Stop shouting.

403
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,890
It's useless to shout here.

404
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:26,760
Isn't this his balcony?

405
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,760
He can definitely hear us from here.

406
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:51,480
Are you a human or a ghost?

407
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:00,280
You don't need to waste your breath.

408
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:02,880
No matter what you say today,

409
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:03,960
I won't go back.

410
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:05,359
Mr. Heying.

411
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,160
If you don't go back,

412
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:08,690
