413
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:09,640
Mr. Heying,

414
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,800
please come back.

415
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:11,400
Xiaoqi,

416
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,210
can you stop making a scene?

417
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:18,819
You summed it up perfectly the other day.

418
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:22,440
After so many years in the musical theater circle,

419
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:25,560
I've gone from being a pretty good leading man

420
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:27,760
to this state.

421
00:17:28,760 --> 00:17:30,480
I lost my leading roles.

422
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:32,080
I lost the director's attention.

423
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,280
I lost the attention of my troupe members.

424
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,610
What else do I have left?

425
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:38,280
I only have one loyal fan left,

426
00:17:38,280 --> 00:17:39,540
and it turns out she's a

427
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,060
nightmare that has been haunting us.

428
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,880
What face do I have to stay?

429
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,880
What's the point of staying?

430
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:47,760
But

431
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,000
do you really think

432
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,240
filming short dramas suits you?

433
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:53,680
Does it matter if it suits me?

434
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,280
It's just the beginning.

435
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:56,740
There's always a process.

436
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:00,960
I signed a ten-drama long-term contract with Charlie Wang.

437
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:02,280
I don't have to worry about not having dramas to film.

438
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:02,840
Jianshe,

439
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:05,840
do you really feel happy filming short dramas?

440
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,840
Whether I'm happy or not,

441
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,840
is it really that important?

442
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,280
Then what is important?

443
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,540
Are musicals no longer important to you?

444
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:16,980
Musicals will always be important to me.

445
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,920
It's just that now,

446
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:23,220
I'm no longer important to musicals.

447
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,280
Jinxi.

448
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:30,560
Actually, after spending so much time together,

449
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:33,690
I've long stopped resenting you for taking my lead role.

450
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,200
I have to admit,

451
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:37,840
you are younger,

452
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:38,640
better,

453
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,840
and have more potential than me.

454
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:40,680
The future of musicals

455
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:42,560
should belong to actors like you.

456
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,480
And now,

457
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,010
I'm no longer fit to play the male lead.

458
00:18:48,080 --> 00:18:50,210
Whether it's our A Chinese Ghost Story

459
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:52,000
or the musical stage,

460
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,240
I'm no longer an indispensable role.

461
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:01,680
I might as well start doing something else.

462
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,860
Maybe I'll do better in film and TV

463
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:05,800
than you.

464
00:19:11,040 --> 00:19:12,200
My mind is made up.

465
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:15,780
You should go back.

466
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:18,680
Jinxi.

467
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:23,530
In that case,

468
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:26,440
don't blame me.

469
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:33,640
Jianshe.

470
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:38,200
You have no future shooting short dramas with Charlie Wang.

471
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:39,400
It was you and Ning Jin

472
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:40,200
who made me realize

473
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:42,260
how terrible my previous acting was.

474
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:44,730
Jianshe.

475
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:45,560
Look,

476
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,840
this is 'Huayue Zhuan' directed by Charlie Wang.

477
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:48,960
Look at the composition.

478
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:49,480
Look at the camera movement.

479
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,200
I won't look.

480
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,080
Look at me.

481
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:51,640
I won't look.

482
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:52,800
Open your eyes.

483
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:53,560
I won't.

484
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:55,400
Sister.

485
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:00,480
Jianshe.

486
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:02,840
You and the director made me Ning Caichen.

487
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:05,240
You can't just give up on yourself like this.

488
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,700
That's right, Mr. Heying.

489
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,680
Maybe you can't always be the leading man.

490
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,940
But you can train countless leading men,

491
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:13,360
just like you did with Jinxi.

492
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:14,080
Exactly.

493
00:20:26,480 --> 00:20:28,080
What's the point of saying this now?

494
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:29,560
I can't turn back.

495
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:33,280
With the long-term contract I signed with King Charlie,

496
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:34,840
he won't let me go.

497
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:37,130
Jianshe.

498
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:38,160
It's fine.

499
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:41,520
I know someone who deals specifically with King Charlie.

500
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:47,040
Young Master, I'm just a cleaner.

501
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,880
Don't do this.

502
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,080
A-Tao.

503
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,920
You are a cleaner,

504
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:55,440
but you not only clean my house,

505
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:56,840
but also my heart.

506
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:00,400
I love you.

507
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:01,760
A-Tao.

508
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,930
I'm the one who truly loves you.

509
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:04,920
Only I

510
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:06,960
can give you this wild feeling.

511
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,970
I'm the one who truly loves you.

512
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,000
Choose me.

513
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,280
Choose me.

514
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:12,440
Choose me, A-Tao.

515
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,640
A-Tao, choose me.

516
00:21:14,360 --> 00:21:14,760
Cut!

517
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:17,480
Don't you understand human words?

518
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,810
Who yelled 'cut' again?

519
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:26,920
Why are you here?

520
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,160
I'm here to visit my artist, Du Heying.

521
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,240
Your artist?

522
00:21:32,800 --> 00:21:33,360
Yes.

523
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,680
He signed with me a long time ago.

524
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:38,320
I was just too busy to check his contract.

525
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,080
Today I found out

526
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:42,400
that his contract violates labor laws.

527
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:43,600
Du Heying,

528
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:46,400
how many hours do you work every day?

529
00:21:50,280 --> 00:21:51,560
About 22 hours.

530
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:54,820
Is there anyone else here who works more than 22 hours a day?

531
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:59,080
Excuse me, are you Jin Xi's manager, Sister Hu?

532
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:00,600
Is your company still recruiting artists?

533
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,130
Why are you joining the fun?

534
00:22:02,320 --> 00:22:03,850
It's none of your business.

535
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,200
Now I

536
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,840
am taking Du Heying away.

537
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:10,890
Your contract is completely invalid.

538
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,000
If you have any problems,

539
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,440
talk to my company's legal department.

540
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:13,800
Go.

541
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:19,210
Didn't you understand?

542
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:29,240
What are you looking at?

543
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:29,840
Continue.

544
00:22:30,560 --> 00:22:30,920
You.

545
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:33,600
You're both the first and second male lead.

546
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:34,320
As for me,

547
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:35,960
I will definitely make you famous.

548
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:37,000
Let's continue on set.

549
00:22:37,000 --> 00:22:37,600
Continue.

550
00:22:38,840 --> 00:22:39,640
Oh my.

551
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,120
That sounds great.

552
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:25,800
Beautiful.

553
00:23:25,800 --> 00:23:26,480
So amazing.

554
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:27,600
He sings so well.

555
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:29,140
As expected of Mr. Heying.

556
00:23:29,760 --> 00:23:31,360
Let's take a 10-minute break.

557
00:23:31,360 --> 00:23:31,960
Director,

558
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:32,800
everyone,

559
00:23:33,760 --> 00:23:36,020
I'd like to take two minutes of your time.

560
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,000
I want to take this opportunity

561
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:41,060
to sincerely apologize to everyone.

562
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:44,940
Actually, my leaving the troupe a while ago,

563
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:47,280
wasn't because of

564
00:23:47,760 --> 00:23:49,290
my personal health issues,

565
00:23:49,560 --> 00:23:50,000
but rather...

566
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:50,460
Heying.

567
00:23:52,360 --> 00:23:54,280
We've been working together for so many years,

568
00:23:54,280 --> 00:23:56,480
and you've never taken a single day off.

569
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:57,800
This time,

570
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:00,600
just treat it as taking them all at once.

571
00:24:23,280 --> 00:24:26,280
Thank you for helping me persuade Heying to come back.

572
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,200
If you want to thank someone,

573
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:29,160
thank Xiaoqi.

574
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:30,400
Xiaoqi?

575
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,120
Your mark is right here.

576
00:24:33,120 --> 00:24:33,440
Okay.

577
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,160
She was the one who found out from Eason

578
00:24:35,160 --> 00:24:37,000
that I went to the studio to look for Brother Jianshe.

579
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,000
So I followed him.

580
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:41,280
Xiao Qi moved Brother Jianshe with her true feelings.

581
00:24:41,280 --> 00:24:44,080
Otherwise, he wouldn't have come back so quickly.

582
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:45,680
True.

583
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:48,360
Xiao Qi has always admired Heying.

584
00:24:49,760 --> 00:24:50,600
I don't think

585
00:24:51,280 --> 00:24:52,540
it's just admiration.

586
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:54,080
Xiao Qi has feelings

587
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,880
for Brother Jianshe.

588
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:57,170
Impossible.

589
00:24:58,040 --> 00:24:59,680
We've been working together for so many years.

590
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:01,010
That doesn't conflict.

591
00:25:02,960 --> 00:25:03,440
No.

592
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:05,500
She's not that kind of person.

593
00:25:16,640 --> 00:25:17,560
Mr. Heying.

594
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:21,920
Xiao Qi.

595
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,640
Thank you so much

596
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:33,020
for spending so much time and effort to persuade me.

597
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,560
It's nothing.

598
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:39,440
For our theater troupe,

599
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:40,240
you really...

600
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,820
you really worked so hard.

601
00:25:44,280 --> 00:25:45,160
I feel ashamed.

602
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:49,840
Mr. Heying,

603
00:25:51,280 --> 00:25:53,560
I might not go this far for anyone else.

604
00:25:54,040 --> 00:25:55,240
But because it's you,

605
00:25:55,320 --> 00:25:56,720
I worked this hard.

606
00:25:57,720 --> 00:25:59,440
I admire your talent,

607
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,320
your aura,

608
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,400
and your dedication to the profession.

609
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,560
I also like you a lot.

610
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:05,200
So,

611
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:08,690
I don't want you to give up on musicals,

612
00:26:08,840 --> 00:26:10,560
I don't want you to leave the troupe,

613
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:13,360
and I definitely don't want to never see you again.

614
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,540
Do you understand?

615
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:19,680
I understand.

616
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,340
Actually, I also hate to leave everyone.

617
00:26:30,800 --> 00:26:31,480
You...

618
00:26:32,080 --> 00:26:33,480
You should go back first.

619
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:51,280
Xiaoqi, what did you just say you'd do to me?

620
00:26:53,720 --> 00:26:54,400
Xiaoqi.

621
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:12,640
Right here.

622
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,600
Where is Jinxi?

623
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:19,240
Recording a song.

624
00:27:20,320 --> 00:27:21,320
Where is Ningjin?

625
00:27:21,320 --> 00:27:22,120
Rehearsing.

626
00:27:31,280 --> 00:27:32,480
Are you sure no one followed you?

627
00:27:32,480 --> 00:27:33,240
No.

628
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:33,760
Okay.
